      "description": "Karoryfer x bigcat solo cello (CC0, Karoryfer Lecolds and bigcat instruments, played by Kamila Borowiak) through our SFZ from tools/make-cello-sfz.py. Bowed keys 34-86 (Bb1-D6, recorded C2-C6), pizzicato keys 34-75 (Bb1-D#5), other keys are silent. Four recorded dynamic layers picked by CC1 at the note start (p up to 42, mp 43-72, mf 73-100, f from 101), CC1 = loudness (24 dB) and brightness inside the note, vibrato added per note (CC21 = depth, also inside a note, default 64, 0 = none), legato notes glide from a fifth of the interval away. Bowed notes need no key calibration; staccato and pizzicato ring out their recordings",
